            <ArticleTitle>Femoral nerve block in extracapsular femoral neck fractures.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>922-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We randomised 50 patients with extracapsular fractures of the femoral neck to receive either a bupivacaine femoral nerve block or systemic analgesia alone. A femoral nerve block was found to be an easy and effective procedure which significantly reduced perioperative analgesic requirements and postoperative morbidity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
